                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg831">p. 831</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1346-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1346-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed. At this point the negotiation lapsed and was not revived again in
                    1914.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
